ailability mutations: 0\n- Low/provisional confidence rows: 0\n- Blocked categorical rows: 0\n\n## Boundary\n- Method Map confidence controls diagnostic strength and copy posture, not question availability.\n- `blocked_quarantined` and `blocked_research_only` are categorical exclusions, not low-confidence rows.\n- Numeric confidence cannot revive blocked evidence into candidate guidance.\n- No UI wording integration, FigureAsset acceptance, rights approval, launch, official scoring, Phase B2, or Supabase mutation is performed.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/method-map-evidence-availability-overlay.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-method-map-evidence-availability-overlay.mjs --write`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-method-map-evidence-availability-overlay.mjs --check`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-method-map-evidence-availability-overlay.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/method-map-evidence-availability-overlay.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nCloses #1169","created_at":"2026-07-02T13:02:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:06:35Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T13:06:22Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T13:06:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"3ad5fea1d2644d3ec8c90243cfffe3274e12fd85","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1182/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1182/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1182/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/94d94be097ceb8aa1363774e2151275e6496aed7","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1169","ref":"f